<title>USA: Acorn Venture stake raised by Asset Value.</title>
<headline>Acorn Venture stake raised by Asset Value.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asset Value Fund LP said Friday it raised its stake in Acorn Venture Capital Corp to 1,104,000 common shares or 19.93 percent from 19.67 percent previously held.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the partnership said its latest transactions include the purchase of 14,325 shares bought between Oct 2 and Oct 15 at prices ranging from $2.0431 to $2.125 per share.</p>
</text>
